/P 156 0 R
/E (Current technologies, such as mobile phones, smartwatches, and computers, can be adapted and used as an assistive technology just by pressing a few buttons. General technology can often have many assistive functions that make them easier to use in everyday situations. All assistive features can be found in the accessibility tab in settings for both Apple and Android products. These can be set-up without an assessment by an OT with no cost or risk to the individual.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
>>
